  "label": "Misogynistic Stereotype: Women are inherently dangerous or threatening to men",
  "description": "This stereotype portrays women as a threat to men, particularly in the context of violence or retaliation. It is rooted in patriarchal ideologies that devalue women and often leads to the justification of violence against women or the demonization of female figures. The phrase 'well ladies, it's time to lock and load' reinforces this by framing women as the enemy to be armed against.",
